{"type":"text","timestamp":1782045641691,"sessionID":"ses_115d1b942ffeMUYxc45D41ktkS","part":{"id":"prt_eea328275001aUieVFLPVGZAXK","messageID":"msg_eea327248001L7KRDEjCkU21EM","sessionID":"ses_115d1b942ffeMUYxc45D41ktkS","type":"text","text":"Done. The Go book collection API is implemented and all tests pass.\n\n**Files created:**\n- `go.mod` / `go.sum` — module `bookapi`, deps `modernc.org/sqlite` (pure-Go, no CGO)\n- `main.go:1` — entrypoint with `-addr` and `-db` flags\n- `store.go:1` — `Book` type, `Store` interface, `SQLiteStore` CRUD implementation\n- `server.go:1` — HTTP handlers using Go 1.22+ `net/http` method/path routing, validation, JSON helpers\n- `store_test.go:1` — SQLite CRUD lifecycle test (1 test, multiple assertions)\n- `server_test.go:1` — HTTP integration tests (4 tests): health, validation, full lifecycle, method-not-allowed\n- `README.md` — setup, run, examples, test docs\n\n**Endpoints:** `POST/GET/PUT/DELETE /books[/{id}]`, `GET /health`, with `?author=` filter, validation (title+author required, year range), and correct status codes (201/200/204/400/404/500).\n\n```\nok  \tbookapi\n```","time":{"start":1782045639285,"end":1782045641689}}}
